### 1. Iniciar Sesión para Obtener Token (Ejecutar primero)
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name login
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "harol",
  "password": "harol1234567+"
}

###

### 2. Registrar una Nueva Venta (Requiere Auth)
@authToken = {{login.response.body.$.accessToken}}

# @name createSale
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/ventas
Authorization: Bearer {{authToken}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "client_id": 1,
  "monto_total": 150000
}
